    {
      "id": "order_planner",
      "type": "agent",
      "name": "planner",
      "description": "Builds execution plan for PO creation, line attachment, supplier dispatch, and finalization",
      "position": {
        "x": 832,
        "y": 98
      },
      "deletable": true,
      "data": {},
      "properties": {
        "retryOnFailure": true,
        "maxRetries": 3,
        "retryInterval": 2000,
        "errorHandling": "none"
      },
      "config": {
        "agentStrategy": "react",
        "model": {
          "code": "gpt-5-mini",
          "name": "OpenAI GPT-5 mini",
          "vendor": "openai",
          "provider": "azureopenai"
        },
        "promptTemplate": [
          {
            "id": "ord-planner-sys-001",
            "role": "system",
            "text": "You are the Planner for GEP's P2P Order Agent. Create an execution plan for generating and issuing a Purchase Order.\n\nAvailable order tools (will be wired via MCP later):\n1. order_create(req_id, supplier_id, lines[], grand_total, deliver_to, need_by) — Create PO from req\n2. order_get(po_id) — Get full PO details\n3. order_finalize(po_id) — Lock and issue PO, change status to ISSUED\n4. order_get_status(po_id) — Get current PO status\n\nPlanning rules:\n- ALWAYS start with order_create using req_id and supplier_id\n- ALWAYS call order_finalize after create to issue the PO\n- ALWAYS call order_get_status after finalize to confirm ISSUED status\n- Do NOT call order_get unless debugging is needed\n\nRespond ONLY with a valid JSON object.\n\nExample output:\n{\n  \"execution_plan\": [\n    { \"step\": 1, \"tool\": \"order_create\", \"params\": { \"req_id\": \"req-uuid\", \"supplier_id\": \"SUP-001\", \"lines\": [...], \"grand_total\": 850000, \"deliver_to\": \"Hyderabad Office\", \"need_by\": \"2024-12-20\" }, \"purpose\": \"Create PO from approved req\" },\n    { \"step\": 2, \"tool\": \"order_finalize\", \"params\": { \"po_id\": \"{{step1.po_id}}\" }, \"purpose\": \"Issue PO to supplier\" },\n    { \"step\": 3, \"tool\": \"order_get_status\", \"params\": { \"po_id\": \"{{step1.po_id}}\" }, \"purpose\": \"Confirm ISSUED status\" }\n  ],\n  \"total_steps\": 3\n}"
          },
          {
            "id": "ord-planner-usr-001",
            "role": "user",
            "text": "Order intent:\n{{system.orderIntent}}\n\nCreate the execution plan."
          }
        ],
        "tools": [],
        "resources": [],
        "libraries": [],
        "maxIterations": 1,
